# Kotlin / Android

- Packages and identifiers in English; UI copy in Portuguese
- Layers: `domain` → `data` → `ui`
- Hilt for DI; Room only in `data`; Navigation Compose in `ui`
- Prefer immutable models; planned vs actual time as separate fields
- One `:app` module with those packages until an ADR says otherwise
